flowchart TD
    accTitle: Vulnerability-Lookup disclosure lifecycle
    accDescr: A reporter submits a private case. The team reviews it, can ask for an update and resume review, reject or close it, or contact the vendor and approve it. The team publishes the record and explicitly sets the case to Disclosed at release.
    submit["Reporter submits a private case"] --> reported["Reported"]
    reported --> review["Under review"]
    review <-->|Request and receive details| wait["Waiting for reporter"]
    review --> stop["Rejected or Closed"]
    review --> vendor["Vendor contacted"]
    vendor --> approved["Approved"]
    approved -->|Publish record and save review| released["Disclosed"]
    class wait,stop muted
    class approved accent
    class released success
